# SMS Integration

- SMS sending lives in `packages/sms`. Never call a carrier API from React components.
- Add a new carrier by implementing `SmsProvider` in `packages/sms/src/providers` and registering it in `createSmsProvider`. Do not rewrite existing providers unless asked to replace them.
- Persist one Message row per recipient before send. Extend send/webhook helpers; do not delete them.
- Ethiopian mobiles normalize to E.164 (`+2519XXXXXXXX`).
- Use Tailwind CSS v4 (`@import "tailwindcss"`).
- App UI and API routes live in `apps/web`. The copyable kit is `packages/sms`.
